---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us - Alberti Home Buyers LLC">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8">About Alberti Home Buyers</h1>

      <div class="bg-brand-purple-tint p-8 rounded-2xl mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
          We help homeowners sell their properties quickly and easily, without the stress and hassle of traditional real estate transactions. We believe that selling a home shouldn't be complicated, time-consuming, or expensive.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Why We're Different</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li>✅ We buy in any condition</li>
            <li>✅ Fair cash offers</li>
            <li>✅ No commissions or fees</li>
            <li>✅ Fast closing process</li>
            <li>✅ Local expertise</li>
            <li>✅ Transparent process</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Our Commitment</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
            We're committed to treating every homeowner with respect and integrity. We listen to your situation, understand your needs, and provide solutions that work for you.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Your satisfaction and trust are what matter most to us.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-purple-tint p-8 rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Experience</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
          With years of experience in the real estate market, we've helped hundreds of homeowners sell their properties quickly and for fair prices. We understand the local market and what makes a good investment.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          Whether your home needs work, you're facing a difficult situation, or you simply want a faster way to sell, we're here to help.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
